# Rust build artifacts
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
target

# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored here: oxiz-cli ships as a binary
# crate, and reproducible binary builds want a committed lockfile
# (see https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/faq.html#why-do-binaries-have-cargolock-in-version-control).
# The root Cargo.lock still needs to be added to git (`git add Cargo.lock`) to
# actually become tracked. Do not re-add a `Cargo.lock` ignore rule here.

